    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a bubble blow-down!! In this multiplayer bubble racing game, shoot bubbles to propel yourself forward and navigate through the twists and turns with speed. Shooting bubbles makes you shrink, so make sure to eat bubbles that other players have shot to maintain your size and slip past the competition! With many unique tracks to choose from, hone your skills and see if you can come out on top against your friends, random strangers, or the CPU racers if you'd rather play alone.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a bubble blow-down!! In this multiplayer bubble racing game, shoot bubbles to propel yourself forward and navigate through the twists and turns with speed. Shooting bubbles makes you shrink, so make sure to eat bubbles that other players have shot to maintain your size and slip past the competition! With many unique tracks to choose from, hone your skills and see if you can come out on top against your friends, random strangers, or the CPU racers if you'd rather play alone.</p>",
    "short_description": "Slipstream is a top-down physics-based racing game where you move by splitting your bubble to propel yourself forward. Manage your fuel as you steal bubbles from other players (or even eat them whole!) Challenge your friends or CPU players and slide yourself to victory!",
